      "Language": "ukr",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "IL-1beta, IL-4, IL-8, IL-10, TNF-alpha content are studied in patients with severe bronchial asthma on the background of basis therapy and complex therapy including omega-3 polyunsaturated fatty acids. Complex therapy appeared to be more effective, considerable decrease in IL-1beta, normalization of IL-4, IL-8, TNF-alpha and increase in IL-10 were detected."},
